            It replaces the thermostat on the wall, not the furnace or air conditioner. If your current thermostat runs both heat and cooling from one wall unit on 24V wiring, a Nest can usually take over both, as long as the compatibility checker approves your wires. It cannot control a window unit, a portable air conditioner, or line-voltage baseboard heat.
